WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.056
Welcome to Pivotglass version zero point nine
point nine.

00:00:04.056 --> 00:00:10.032
This edited walkthrough uses real screens from
an isolated, synthetic investigation.

00:00:10.032 --> 00:00:14.230
No live intelligence service or language model
is required.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:21.060
The cockpit brings questions, evidence,
alternative explanations, and analyst decisions
into one

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:21.772
workspace.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.932
Novice mode starts with a conversation.

00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:26.432
What data do you have?

00:00:26.432 --> 00:00:27.387
What happened?

00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:33.934
The question coach helps a new analyst describe
the source, the observed event, and the decision

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:36.321
the investigation needs to support.

00:00:36.321 --> 00:00:40.276
Coaching is a practice aid, not a substitute for
evidence.

00:00:40.776 --> 00:00:42.669
Do you know how it started?

00:00:42.669 --> 00:00:45.194
Here the analyst explicitly says no.

00:00:45.194 --> 00:00:47.227
That unknown remains visible.

00:00:47.227 --> 00:00:52.556
Useful analysis does not fill a missing origin
story with a confident guess.

00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:56.008
The coach proposes investigative questions.

00:00:56.008 --> 00:01:02.534
The analyst edits a question to ask what
independent evidence distinguishes common
control from

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:03.564
shared hosting.

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:09.402
Saving is an explicit decision; a draft becomes
a durable question only after review.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:13.631
A short reflection records what the analyst
practiced.

00:01:13.631 --> 00:01:19.984
Repeated work builds habits: state the decision,
separate observations from assumptions, and

00:01:19.984 --> 00:01:23.506
identify evidence that could change the
conclusion.

00:01:23.506 --> 00:01:28.547
Practice history records participation, not a
certification of expertise.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:34.612
The analytical workbench keeps competing
hypotheses and contradictory evidence visible.

00:01:34.612 --> 00:01:39.154
Structured techniques help the analyst challenge
a favored explanation.

00:01:39.154 --> 00:01:45.230
A contradiction is something to investigate and
disposition, rather than hide to make a cleaner

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:45.870
narrative.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.926
The constellation is a navigation aid for the
admitted evidence.

00:01:50.926 --> 00:01:53.275
It helps locate objects and gaps.

00:01:53.275 --> 00:01:59.896
Position and visual emphasis do not establish
adversary ownership, confidence, or importance.

00:02:00.396 --> 00:02:05.771
Open an indicator to inspect its complete value
and stored relationships.

00:02:05.771 --> 00:02:10.041
In this synthetic case, a file communicates with
a domain.

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:16.520
A relationship supports a specific observation;
it does not, by itself, establish common

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:17.109
control.

00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:21.829
The detail view exposes provenance and
collection history.

00:02:21.829 --> 00:02:28.523
Source identifiers, timestamps, response hashes,
and conflicting results let another analyst

00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:31.361
examine where an observation came from.

00:02:31.361 --> 00:02:34.490
A model summary is not the original source.

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:38.236
Local document intake first previews candidates.

00:02:38.236 --> 00:02:42.970
This synthetic document contains a domain and a
deliberately long URL.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:48.043
The analyst selects both, then explicitly admits
the source and candidates.

00:02:48.043 --> 00:02:51.830
Previewing alone does not add evidence to the
workspace.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.543
The source library retains the admitted document
and its digest.

00:02:56.543 --> 00:03:02.665
After restarting the isolated service, the same
source and admitted objects remain available.

00:03:02.665 --> 00:03:07.075
Keeping source material makes review and later
correction possible.

00:03:07.575 --> 00:03:13.378
Provenance history shows the actual workflow:
document admission, creation of an analyst

00:03:13.378 --> 00:03:16.412
promotion group, and two candidate admissions.

00:03:16.412 --> 00:03:21.556
The branches record the analyst decision to
promote these candidates together.

00:03:21.556 --> 00:03:26.370
They do not assert a shared adversary or an
observed threat relationship.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:31.354
The relationship graph now shows seven nodes and
five visible edges.

00:03:31.354 --> 00:03:37.224
Stored relationships use their own edge style;
analyst grouping uses dotted yellow edges.

00:03:37.224 --> 00:03:39.598
The long URL wraps inside its label.

00:03:39.598 --> 00:03:44.808
The analyst can read the complete value and
distinguish grouping from evidence.

00:03:45.308 --> 00:03:49.400
The analyst records an explicit evidence link
with a rationale.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:55.247
Here, a synthetic observation supports the
shared hosting alternative without establishing

00:03:55.247 --> 00:03:55.766
control.

00:03:55.766 --> 00:04:01.937
The ledger stores the link as an analyst
judgment, preserving the observation and the
competing

00:04:01.937 --> 00:04:02.652
hypothesis.

00:04:03.153 --> 00:04:07.295
Generate a deterministic report from the current
workspace.

00:04:07.295 --> 00:04:13.683
The report retains the investigative questions,
alternative explanations, explicit evidence

00:04:13.683 --> 00:04:18.386
links, unresolved contradictions, and next
collection requirements.

00:04:18.386 --> 00:04:22.107
It is a handoff for review, not an automatic
verdict.

00:04:22.107 --> 00:04:27.863
The analyst still checks the assessment,
limitations, and handling before sharing.

00:04:28.363 --> 00:04:34.475
Configuration separates optional intelligence
and model services from the local workflow.

00:04:34.475 --> 00:04:39.900
Enable providers deliberately and understand
their network and data boundaries.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:46.355
The implementation and operations guides
document prerequisites, backup, restore,
maintenance,

00:04:46.355 --> 00:04:47.797
and failure recovery.

00:04:48.297 --> 00:04:52.497
Personas and themes give the workspace a
distinctive atmosphere.

00:04:52.497 --> 00:04:54.794
This is the Nightgrid presentation.

00:04:54.794 --> 00:05:00.964
Visuals and optional sound help the working
experience; neither changes evidence or
analytical

00:05:00.964 --> 00:05:01.620
authority.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:07.658
Start with the offline quickstart, then follow
the user guide through a reviewed, defensible

00:05:07.658 --> 00:05:08.183
handoff.
